dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.animation.diff
version 1
schema stdio.semio.animation
start body
framing record

# animation wave: REAL binary diff frame, replacing the old `print_diff().into_bytes()` text-as-
# binary shortcut (`🔺️diff/🦀️.rs`'s old `DiffCodec::encode_diff`). `format u8` +
# `presence u8` (bit0=`timelines` — the only collection this facet has, unlike brep's 6/flow's
# 2) are two REAL fixed fields; past that, one opaque `payload` chain follows, present only when
# `presence` bit0 is set (the same `enc_indexed_triple`-produced text this facet's own `print_diff`
# already emits) — no length prefix needed since it is the last, and only, field in the frame. The
# real Rust `encode_diff`/`decode_diff` stays genuinely, fully structured — round-trip tested
# independently.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field presence u8

chain payload bytes
